    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e2eebf19c1a33f336e2d105616cfeccc.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e2eebf19c1a33f336e2d105616cfeccc.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Dice Goblin's Den is a 2D side-scrolling Tower Defense Roguelite game where you defend your fellow Goblins from waves of &quot;<i>heroes</i>&quot; who have been given quests at the local tavern to raid and loot your home! Gain new abilities as you unlock new classes by defeating enemy party leaders and reclaiming their loot! Learn the quirks of each class, and how their spells affect your units!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/14256bb8b6c64261b9b4c6d9fad37fac.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/14256bb8b6c64261b9b4c6d9fad37fac.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e7271cb7ce69a584d2a0d4aad6904a11.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e7271cb7ce69a584d2a0d4aad6904a11.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e7271cb7ce69a584d2a0d4aad6904a11.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wouldn't be very dicey without all the uncertainty of a Roguelite, now would it?! Play with randomized levels, enemies, loot, and upgrades! Every playthrough is its own unique experience, and it's up to you to beat the odds by adapting to what luck throws your way, choosing the best rewards for the occasion, and employing clever strategies. But be careful! Defeat will set you right back to the drawing board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e01a3b05225abdd8349a0fdbccd31c52.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e01a3b05225abdd8349a0fdbccd31c52.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/7ea506c95f14e1906dcb6c3b8a0a8f9a.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/7ea506c95f14e1906dcb6c3b8a0a8f9a.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/7ea506c95f14e1906dcb6c3b8a0a8f9a.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and manage your own economy, but be wary of the balance of allocating them between combat and worker units. It can be dangerous to spend too many resources hiring workers instead of combat units to defend your goblin den, but sometimes being greedy pays off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/cd7f98a70d1ec3de20b7b2fbf826fc17.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/cd7f98a70d1ec3de20b7b2fbf826fc17.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/cd7f98a70d1ec3de20b7b2fbf826fc17.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/8d426dfbfbaa888d5daaf559dc02a020.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/8d426dfbfbaa888d5daaf559dc02a020.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/77437b7ea9f390eea804a30293b737cc.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=608 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/77437b7ea9f390eea804a30293b737cc.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/77437b7ea9f390eea804a30293b737cc.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Carefully place your combat units in strategic sequences that best complement your party leader's special abilities as well as the surrounding terrain! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/51e8e5a40b3c23aef89c679cfdb9e3bb.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/51e8e5a40b3c23aef89c679cfdb9e3bb.apng?t=1755258612\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=64 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/4612b64bc4aa9482950ab80c458d710f.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=608 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/4612b64bc4aa9482950ab80c458d710f.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/4612b64bc4aa9482950ab80c458d710f.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build your way upwards with the resources your fellow goblins worked hard to gather, and overwhelm the enemy with your superior numbers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/df80fe938cc4264d25efbc2f0ba33f7b.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/df80fe938cc4264d25efbc2f0ba33f7b.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e9b97b9676bc74a22e470a9e59c5f7f4.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e9b97b9676bc74a22e470a9e59c5f7f4.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e9b97b9676bc74a22e470a9e59c5f7f4.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Destroy the enemy forces who are quested with the task of raiding your party and looting your corpses, but don't forget to keep your fellow goblins alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/20eb903e9e0e8355af8166dc927e7e0b.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/20eb903e9e0e8355af8166dc927e7e0b.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/a585b852ce2f498a47b9996bbde6dc98.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/a585b852ce2f498a47b9996bbde6dc98.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/a585b852ce2f498a47b9996bbde6dc98.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Upgrade your goblins by way of spells, abilities, and attributes at the cost of resources! But be careful not to put all of your dice in one basket! <i>Goblins together strong!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/a5805aa1dc95d56ba6f510e8bedd3c70.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/a5805aa1dc95d56ba6f510e8bedd3c70.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/420a65664a6bd3a9ede23dfa40c67ced.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/420a65664a6bd3a9ede23dfa40c67ced.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/420a65664a6bd3a9ede23dfa40c67ced.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unlock new classes to play when you defeat each enemy party leader! Each class has its own abilities that can alter your tactics and benefit your goblins in a unique way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/483c96040a01270802cb45ff9685b127.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/483c96040a01270802cb45ff9685b127.apng?t=1755258612\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=64 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/87b5bd6daf80eaf2bb3cf51a55876bae.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/87b5bd6daf80eaf2bb3cf51a55876bae.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/87b5bd6daf80eaf2bb3cf51a55876bae.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Journey to the next level of your choosing! New levels means new enemies, differing resource allocations, and miscellaneous changes to adapt to! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/938e2786140293a4642ab7edd0f55076.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/938e2786140293a4642ab7edd0f55076.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/0251a555833d65b28f2667987f087a9a.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=640 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/0251a555833d65b28f2667987f087a9a.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/0251a555833d65b28f2667987f087a9a.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Coming soon to a Goblin's Den near you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/609009fce137b6f01c852506ffa799e8.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/609009fce137b6f01c852506ffa799e8.apng?t=1755258612\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=64 /></picture></span> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/31ba5243242e389c87e2b104773972b5.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/31ba5243242e389c87e2b104773972b5.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e2eebf19c1a33f336e2d105616cfeccc.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e2eebf19c1a33f336e2d105616cfeccc.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Dice Goblin's Den is a 2D side-scrolling Tower Defense Roguelite game where you defend your fellow Goblins from waves of &quot;<i>heroes</i>&quot; who have been given quests at the local tavern to raid and loot your home! Gain new abilities as you unlock new classes by defeating enemy party leaders and reclaiming their loot! Learn the quirks of each class, and how their spells affect your units!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/14256bb8b6c64261b9b4c6d9fad37fac.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/14256bb8b6c64261b9b4c6d9fad37fac.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e7271cb7ce69a584d2a0d4aad6904a11.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e7271cb7ce69a584d2a0d4aad6904a11.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e7271cb7ce69a584d2a0d4aad6904a11.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wouldn't be very dicey without all the uncertainty of a Roguelite, now would it?! Play with randomized levels, enemies, loot, and upgrades! Every playthrough is its own unique experience, and it's up to you to beat the odds by adapting to what luck throws your way, choosing the best rewards for the occasion, and employing clever strategies. But be careful! Defeat will set you right back to the drawing board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e01a3b05225abdd8349a0fdbccd31c52.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e01a3b05225abdd8349a0fdbccd31c52.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/7ea506c95f14e1906dcb6c3b8a0a8f9a.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/7ea506c95f14e1906dcb6c3b8a0a8f9a.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/7ea506c95f14e1906dcb6c3b8a0a8f9a.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and manage your own economy, but be wary of the balance of allocating them between combat and worker units. It can be dangerous to spend too many resources hiring workers instead of combat units to defend your goblin den, but sometimes being greedy pays off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/cd7f98a70d1ec3de20b7b2fbf826fc17.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/cd7f98a70d1ec3de20b7b2fbf826fc17.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/cd7f98a70d1ec3de20b7b2fbf826fc17.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/8d426dfbfbaa888d5daaf559dc02a020.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/8d426dfbfbaa888d5daaf559dc02a020.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/77437b7ea9f390eea804a30293b737cc.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=608 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/77437b7ea9f390eea804a30293b737cc.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/77437b7ea9f390eea804a30293b737cc.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Carefully place your combat units in strategic sequences that best complement your party leader's special abilities as well as the surrounding terrain! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/51e8e5a40b3c23aef89c679cfdb9e3bb.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/51e8e5a40b3c23aef89c679cfdb9e3bb.apng?t=1755258612\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=64 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/4612b64bc4aa9482950ab80c458d710f.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=608 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/4612b64bc4aa9482950ab80c458d710f.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/4612b64bc4aa9482950ab80c458d710f.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build your way upwards with the resources your fellow goblins worked hard to gather, and overwhelm the enemy with your superior numbers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/df80fe938cc4264d25efbc2f0ba33f7b.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/df80fe938cc4264d25efbc2f0ba33f7b.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e9b97b9676bc74a22e470a9e59c5f7f4.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e9b97b9676bc74a22e470a9e59c5f7f4.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/e9b97b9676bc74a22e470a9e59c5f7f4.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Destroy the enemy forces who are quested with the task of raiding your party and looting your corpses, but don't forget to keep your fellow goblins alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/20eb903e9e0e8355af8166dc927e7e0b.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/20eb903e9e0e8355af8166dc927e7e0b.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/a585b852ce2f498a47b9996bbde6dc98.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/a585b852ce2f498a47b9996bbde6dc98.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/a585b852ce2f498a47b9996bbde6dc98.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Upgrade your goblins by way of spells, abilities, and attributes at the cost of resources! But be careful not to put all of your dice in one basket! <i>Goblins together strong!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/a5805aa1dc95d56ba6f510e8bedd3c70.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/a5805aa1dc95d56ba6f510e8bedd3c70.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/420a65664a6bd3a9ede23dfa40c67ced.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/420a65664a6bd3a9ede23dfa40c67ced.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/420a65664a6bd3a9ede23dfa40c67ced.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unlock new classes to play when you defeat each enemy party leader! Each class has its own abilities that can alter your tactics and benefit your goblins in a unique way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/483c96040a01270802cb45ff9685b127.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/483c96040a01270802cb45ff9685b127.apng?t=1755258612\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=64 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/87b5bd6daf80eaf2bb3cf51a55876bae.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/87b5bd6daf80eaf2bb3cf51a55876bae.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/87b5bd6daf80eaf2bb3cf51a55876bae.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Journey to the next level of your choosing! New levels means new enemies, differing resource allocations, and miscellaneous changes to adapt to! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/938e2786140293a4642ab7edd0f55076.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/938e2786140293a4642ab7edd0f55076.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/0251a555833d65b28f2667987f087a9a.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=640 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/0251a555833d65b28f2667987f087a9a.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/0251a555833d65b28f2667987f087a9a.mp4?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Coming soon to a Goblin's Den near you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/609009fce137b6f01c852506ffa799e8.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/609009fce137b6f01c852506ffa799e8.apng?t=1755258612\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=64 /></picture></span> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/31ba5243242e389c87e2b104773972b5.poster.avif?t=1755258612\" width=600 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196940/extras/31ba5243242e389c87e2b104773972b5.webm?t=1755258612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
